<title>CHINA: TRADING IN CHEVALIER INT'L SUSPENDED.</title>
<headline>TRADING IN CHEVALIER INT'L SUSPENDED.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Chevalier International Holdings Ltd, Chevalier Construction Holdings Ltd and Chevalier Development International Ltd was suspended at the companies' request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Chevalier International shares ended at HK$2.30 on Monday, Chevalier Construction at HK$1.33, and Chevalier Development at HK$3.875.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
